<title>PORTUGAL: MOTOR RACING-PRACTICE TIMES AT PORTUGUESE GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-PRACTICE TIMES AT PORTUGUESE GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>ESTORIL, Portugal 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times after</p>
<p>Friday's practice sessions for Sunday's Portuguese Grand Prix:</p>
<p>1. Michael Schumacher (Germany) Ferrari one minute and 23.554</p>
<p>seconds (average speed 187.854 kph)</p>
<p>2. Damon Hill (Britain) Williams 1:24.281</p>
<p>3. Ukyo Katayama (Japan) Tyrrell 1:24.359</p>
<p>4. Eddie Irvine (Britain) Ferrari 1:24.477</p>
<p>5. Jacques Villeneuve (Canada) Williams 1:24.764</p>
<p>6. Jean Alesi (France) Benetton 1:24.803</p>
<p>7. Gerhard Berger (Austria) Benetton 1:24.832</p>
<p>8. Mika Salo (Finland) Tyrrell 1:25.234</p>
<p>9. Mika Hakkinen (Finland) McLaren 1:25.403</p>
<p>10. Heinz-Harald Frentzen (Germany) Sauber 1:25.567</p>
</text>
